@startuml backend_architecture
title Backend Runtime - UML Component Diagram

skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam shadowing false

component "Tutoring.Api" as Api
component "MediatR handlers" as Handlers
component "Tutoring.Infrastructure" as Infrastructure
component "Tutoring.Domain" as Domain
component "OutboxProcessor" as OutboxProcessor <<hosted service>>
component "RabbitMqPublisher" as Publisher
component "EmailConsumer" as EmailConsumer <<hosted service>>
component "EmailEventDispatcher" as Dispatcher
component "SmtpMailer" as Mailer
database "SQL Server" as SqlServer
queue "RabbitMQ" as RabbitMq
component "SMTP / Mailpit" as Smtp

Api --> Handlers : dispatches requests
Handlers --> Infrastructure : TutoringDbContext and services
Handlers --> Domain : domain behavior
Infrastructure --> SqlServer : EF Core
OutboxProcessor --> SqlServer : reads OutboxMessages
OutboxProcessor --> Publisher : publishes events
Publisher --> RabbitMq : topic exchange
RabbitMq --> EmailConsumer : email queue
EmailConsumer --> Dispatcher : dispatches event
Dispatcher --> Mailer : handles UserRegistered
Mailer --> Smtp : SMTP

note right of OutboxProcessor
Registered only outside
the IntegrationTests environment.
end note
@enduml
